{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","settings":{"show_page_title":true,"disable_top_spacing":false,"disable_bottom_spacing":true}},"rich_text_LUqyjN":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_iXa4FM":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"WE USE MATERIALS THAT ARE :","size":"h4"}}},"block_order":["heading_iXa4FM"],"settings":{"section_width":"grid","text_width":"medium","text_position":"center","text_alignment":"center","color_bg":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","color_text":"#151515","color_links":"#151515","disable_top_spacing":false,"disable_bottom_spacing":true}},"text_with_icons_L8Ax8N":{"type":"text-with-icons","blocks":{"icon_FMkypg":{"type":"icon","settings":{"icon":"plant","heading":"Vegan","text":""}},"icon_3g66E3":{"type":"icon","settings":{"icon":"paw_print","heading":"100% cruelty-free","text":""}},"icon_rBJiRQ":{"type":"icon","settings":{"icon":"heart","heading":"Have premium finish","text":""}},"icon_37rbjp":{"type":"icon","settings":{"icon":"box","heading":"With recyclable packaging","text":""}}},"block_order":["icon_FMkypg","icon_3g66E3","icon_rBJiRQ","icon_37rbjp"],"settings":{"text_alignment":"left","icon_position":"left","icon_size":"medium","heading_size":"large","mobile_swipe":true,"color_bg":"#a79481","color_heading":"#FFFFFF","color_text":"#FFFFFF","disable_top_spacing":true,"disable_bottom_spacing":true}},"rich_text_zCCXJp":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"text_rWPGft":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<h6>We spend a lot of time researching high-quality alternatives to animal leather to create our products; durability, aesthetics & premium finish is our goal.<\/h6><h6>Currently, we use breakthrough innovations in plant-based leathers made from apples, cactus and corn in our handbags. We also use many forms of recycled vegan leathers and microfiber to create a luxurious suede.<\/h6>","custom_liquid":"","size":"text-size-small"}}},"block_order":["text_rWPGft"],"settings":{"section_width":"grid","text_width":"xlarge","text_position":"center","text_alignment":"center","color_bg":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","color_text":"#151515","color_links":"#151515","disable_top_spacing":false,"disable_bottom_spacing":false}},"spacer_irAfJG":{"type":"spacer","disabled":true,"settings":{"spacer_mobile":50,"spacer_desktop":100,"border_separator":false,"border_separator_full":false}},"tabbed_content_MbdxJL":{"type":"tabbed-content","blocks":{"tab_U4H9LL":{"type":"tab","settings":{"tab_label":"Apple Leather","icon":"apple","text":"<p>Made from leftover pomace and peel from fruit juice and compote industry. It is eco-friendly compared to animal leather, as it is primarily composed of organic waste.<\/p><ul><li>Apple cores, skin, seeds & pulp are dried out and crushed into fine powder<\/li><li>The powder is then mixed with polyutherane<\/li><li>The mixture is then coated into a material backing such as cotton and polyester canvas<\/li><li>The result is an apple leather, which is waterproof, long-lasting & highly durable.<\/li><\/ul>","text_columns":"1","page":""}},"tab_4Vg6Y4":{"type":"tab","settings":{"tab_label":"Cactus Leather","icon":"plant","text":"<p>Cactus leather is a highly eco-friendly option to traditional leather.<\/p><ul><li>The cactus is harvested & mature leaves are cut, cleaned and mashed. The entire crop is not plucked, only the leaves are used.<\/li><li>The product is dried in the sun and then grinded into a powder.<\/li><li>The powder is then mixed with a patented formular to produce the cactus leather.<\/li><\/ul><p>Since, cactus is a water-conserving plant, meaning that limited water resources are needed to process this plant. And the performance of cactus leather is very comparable to traditional leathers.<\/p>","text_columns":"1","page":""}},"tab_f6zBeV":{"type":"tab","settings":{"tab_label":"Microfiber Leather","icon":"heart","text":"<p>Microfiber leather is a vegan material that combines microfibers with a polymer base (typically made by mixing polyester and nylon fibres).<\/p><p>The result is a luxurious suede finish leather that looks very close to animal leather. Our Trapees bag’s outlook is entirely composed of microfiber leather.<\/p>","text_columns":"1","page":""}}},"block_order":["tab_U4H9LL","tab_4Vg6Y4","tab_f6zBeV"],"settings":{"heading":"LEARN MORE ABOUT OUR PLANT-BASED LEATHER :","description":"","text_width":"medium","tab_alignment":"center","text_alignment":"left","color_bg":"#ffffff","color_tabs":"#151515","color_text":"#151515","color_border":"#e2e2e2","disable_top_spacing":true,"disable_bottom_spacing":true}},"spacer_3WdzDi":{"type":"spacer","settings":{"spacer_mobile":50,"spacer_desktop":70,"border_separator":true,"border_separator_full":true}},"gallery_dE7Ty4":{"type":"gallery","blocks":{"image_MGDeGF":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/leather_1.jpg","subheading":"","title":"","text":"","link_label":"","link":"","use_text_button":false,"block_link":"","product_list":[]}},"image_HD8gHd":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/pracchhiiiiiiiiiii.jpg","subheading":"","title":"","text":"","link_label":"","link":"","use_text_button":false,"block_link":"","product_list":[]}},"image_8hNYXE":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/farishaaaaaaaaaaaaaa.jpg","subheading":"","title":"","text":"","link_label":"","link":"","use_text_button":false,"block_link":"","product_list":[]}}},"block_order":["image_MGDeGF","image_HD8gHd","image_8hNYXE"],"settings":{"columns_desktop":3,"section_width":"grid","mobile_swipe":false,"image_ratio":"square","content_position":"bottom-left","text_alignment":"left","column_spacing":"small","heading_size":"h2","overlay_color":"#000000","overlay_opacity":0,"disable_top_spacing":false,"disable_bottom_spacing":false}},"spacer_QLEPLn":{"type":"spacer","settings":{"spacer_mobile":50,"spacer_desktop":45,"border_separator":false,"border_separator_full":false}}},"order":["main","rich_text_LUqyjN","text_with_icons_L8Ax8N","rich_text_zCCXJp","spacer_irAfJG","tabbed_content_MbdxJL","spacer_3WdzD